+# Per-link click limits
+
+Create a link with an optional `maxClicks` value from `1` through `1,000,000`. A link without `maxClicks` remains unlimited. For capped links, each permitted redirect records a click synchronously and atomically; after the limit is reached, further redirects return HTTP 410 Gone.
+
+The exhausted-link response uses RFC 7807 ProblemDetails with `application/problem+json`. Its status and detail are:
+
+```json
+{
+  "status": 410,
+  "detail": "The link has reached its click limit."
+}
+```
+
+The response may also contain standard ProblemDetails fields such as `type` and `title`.
